a -> sum: 2 to 3 clock(s) on clk

W001 the value arrives 2 clock(s) one way and 3 the other
  Almost always one branch was pipelined and the other was not, and
  the control signal no longer lines up with the data it escorts. Both
  numbers are given because the average is a depth that is nowhere in
  the design.

2 way(s) through
